# The PARENT repo's .gitignore ignores `data/` and `.claude/` globally (for the
# Python project). Re-include THIS app's own data + launch config so the
# Next.js app is self-contained and actually builds from a clean clone.
!data/
!.claude/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Private imported deal data — keep the template + README, ignore real drops
data/inbound/*.csv
!data/inbound/*.example.csv
